WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.990
The Sun, from one light-year.

00:02.690 --> 00:06.050
From here the whole Solar System is smaller than a pixel.

00:06.500 --> 00:17.201
Light from the Sun takes a year to reach this spot; Voyager 1, the fastest thing we have sent out of the Solar System, would take about eighteen thousand.
